health|noun|B1|8|health||How well your body and mind are.|Exercise is good for your health.|sức khỏe|
diet|noun|B1|9|health;food|🥗|The food you usually eat.|A healthy diet has lots of vegetables.|chế độ ăn|
vitamin|noun|B1|9|health;food||Something in food that helps your body stay healthy.|Oranges have lots of vitamin C.|vitamin|
illness|noun|B1|9|health|🤒|When you are ill.|A cold is a common illness.|bệnh tật|
injury|noun|B1|9|health;sports|🩹|A hurt part of your body.|He has a knee injury.|chấn thương|plural=injuries
emergency|noun|B1|9|health|🚨|A sudden dangerous situation where help is needed fast.|In an emergency, call 115.|trường hợp khẩn cấp|plural=emergencies
climate|noun|B1|9|nature;weather||The usual weather in a place.|Viet Nam has a hot climate.|khí hậu|
global warming|noun|B1|9|nature;science|🌡️|When the Earth slowly gets hotter.|Global warming melts the ice at the North Pole.|sự nóng lên toàn cầu|
flood|noun|B1|9|nature;weather||When a lot of water covers land that is usually dry.|The flood covered the fields.|lũ lụt|
drought|noun|B1|9|nature;weather||A long time with no rain.|The drought made the river dry.|hạn hán|
forest fire|noun|B1|9|nature||A big fire that burns trees in a forest.|The forest fire burned for days.|cháy rừng|
nature|noun|B1|8|nature|🌿|Plants, animals, mountains and seas — everything not made by people.|We go for a walk in nature.|thiên nhiên|
species|noun|B1|9|animals;science||A group of animals or plants of the same kind.|There are many species of bird in the park.|loài|plural=species
habitat|noun|B1|9|animals;nature||The natural home of an animal or plant.|The jungle is the tiger's habitat.|môi trường sống|
extinct|adjective|B1|9|animals;science|🦕|No longer living anywhere.|Dinosaurs are extinct.|tuyệt chủng|
endangered|adjective|B1|9|animals||Might soon be extinct.|Pandas are an endangered animal.|có nguy cơ tuyệt chủng|
solar|adjective|B1|9|science;space|☀️|From or about the sun.|Our school has solar panels.|(thuộc) mặt trời|
oxygen|noun|B1|9|science||A gas in the air that we need to breathe.|Trees give us oxygen.|khí ô-xy|
gravity|noun|B1|9|science;space||The force that pulls things down to the ground.|Gravity makes the apple fall.|trọng lực|
universe|noun|B1|9|science;space|🌌|All of space and everything in it.|The universe is very, very big.|vũ trụ|plural=universes
galaxy|noun|B1|9|science;space|🌌|A very large group of stars.|We live in the Milky Way galaxy.|thiên hà|plural=galaxies
telescope|noun|B1|9|science;space|🔭|A tube you look through to see things far away.|We look at the moon through a telescope.|kính thiên văn|
microscope|noun|B1|9|science|🔬|A machine that makes very small things look bigger.|We look at a leaf under the microscope.|kính hiển vi|
laboratory|noun|B1|9|science;places|🧪|A room where scientists do experiments.|The scientist works in a laboratory.|phòng thí nghiệm|plural=laboratories
technology|noun|B1|9|technology|💻|New machines and ways of doing things using science.|Technology helps us talk to people far away.|công nghệ|plural=technologies
device|noun|B1|9|technology|📱|A small machine for a special job.|A phone is a useful device.|thiết bị|
app|noun|B1|9|technology|📱|A program on a phone or tablet.|This app helps me learn English.|ứng dụng|
password|noun|B1|9|technology|🔑|A secret word that lets you use a computer or website.|Never tell anyone your password.|mật khẩu|
online|adjective|B1|9|technology|🌐|On the internet.|We play an online game together.|trực tuyến|
digital|adjective|B1|9|technology||Using computers and electronic things.|I have a digital camera.|kỹ thuật số|
signal|noun|B1|9|technology|📶|Sounds or pictures sent through the air, or a sign.|There is no phone signal here.|tín hiệu|
programme|noun|B1|8|technology|📺|A show on TV or radio.|My favourite TV programme is about animals.|chương trình|
advertisement|noun|B1|9|shopping|📢|A picture, film or words that try to make you buy something.|There are too many advertisements on TV.|quảng cáo|
news|noun|B1|9|technology|📰|Information about things that have just happened.|Dad watches the news every evening.|tin tức|
article|noun|B1|9|school||A piece of writing in a newspaper or magazine.|I read an article about whales.|bài báo|
author|noun|B1|9|school;jobs|✍️|A person who writes books.|Who is the author of this book?|tác giả|
poem|noun|B1|9|school||A piece of writing with short lines, often with rhyming words.|We learn a poem by heart.|bài thơ|
novel|noun|B1|9|hobbies|📖|A long story in a book.|She is reading a novel about a dragon.|tiểu thuyết|
biography|noun|B1|9|school||A book about someone's life.|I read a biography of a famous scientist.|tiểu sử|plural=biographies
event|noun|B1|9|culture||Something important that happens.|Sports day is a big event at our school.|sự kiện|
ceremony|noun|B1|9|culture||A formal event for a special day.|There is a ceremony at the start of the school year.|buổi lễ|plural=ceremonies
tradition|noun|B1|9|culture||Something people have done the same way for a long time.|Giving lucky money at Tet is a tradition.|truyền thống|
custom|noun|B1|9|culture||Something that people in a place usually do.|It is a custom to take off your shoes at home.|phong tục|
religion|noun|B1|9|culture||Belief in a god or gods.|There are many religions in the world.|tôn giáo|
society|noun|B1|9|people||All the people living together in a country.|Teachers are important in society.|xã hội|plural=societies
population|noun|B1|9|places;people||The number of people who live in a place.|The population of Ha Noi is very big.|dân số|
citizen|noun|B1|9|people||A person who belongs to a country.|She is a citizen of Viet Nam.|công dân|
government|noun|B1|9|people||The group of people who lead a country.|The government builds new schools.|chính phủ|
president|noun|B1|9|people||The leader of some countries or organisations.|The president visits our city.|tổng thống (chủ tịch)|
kingdom|noun|B1|9|places||A country ruled by a king or queen.|The story is about a magic kingdom.|vương quốc|
army|noun|B1|9|people||A large group of soldiers.|The king's army guards the castle.|quân đội|plural=armies
soldier|noun|B1|9|people;jobs||A person in an army.|The soldier stands by the gate.|người lính|
law|noun|B1|9|people||A rule that everyone in a country must follow.|It is the law to wear a helmet on a motorbike.|luật pháp|
lawyer|noun|B1|9|jobs||A person who helps people with the law.|My aunt is a lawyer.|luật sư|
judge|noun|B1|9|jobs||A person who decides who wins a competition, or who is right in a court.|The judges give her ten points.|giám khảo (thẩm phán)|
volunteer|noun|B1|9|people||A person who works for free to help others.|Volunteers clean the beach.|tình nguyện viên|
charity|noun|B1|9|people|💝|A group that collects money to help people.|We give our old toys to charity.|tổ chức từ thiện|plural=charities
community|noun|B1|9|people;places||The people living in one area.|Our community has a big garden.|cộng đồng|plural=communities
organisation|noun|B1|9|people||A group of people working together for a purpose.|The organisation helps animals.|tổ chức|
career|noun|B1|9|jobs||The jobs you do during your life.|She wants a career in science.|sự nghiệp|
salary|noun|B1|9|jobs||Money you get every month for your job.|A pilot's salary is high.|tiền lương|plural=salaries
interview|noun|B1|9|jobs||A meeting where someone asks you questions.|The journalist has an interview with the singer.|cuộc phỏng vấn|
architect|noun|B1|9|jobs||A person who designs buildings.|The architect draws a new school.|kiến trúc sư|
designer|noun|B1|9|jobs||A person who plans how things will look.|She is a fashion designer.|nhà thiết kế|
inventor|noun|B1|9|jobs;science||A person who invents something.|Who was the inventor of the telephone?|nhà phát minh|
explorer|noun|B1|9|travel||A person who travels to new places to learn about them.|The explorer finds a new island.|nhà thám hiểm|
passenger|noun|B1|9|travel||A person travelling in a car, bus, train or plane.|The bus has twenty passengers.|hành khách|
vehicle|noun|B1|9|transport||A machine that carries people or things, like a car or bus.|No vehicles in the park.|phương tiện (xe cộ)|
engine|noun|B1|9|transport||The part of a car or plane that makes it move.|The car engine is very loud.|động cơ|
fuel|noun|B1|9|transport||Something you burn to make heat or power, like petrol.|Cars need fuel to go.|nhiên liệu|
petrol|noun|B1|9|transport|⛽|Fuel for cars and motorbikes.|We stop to buy petrol.|xăng|
destination|noun|B1|9|travel|📍|The place you are travelling to.|Our destination is Da Nang.|điểm đến|
progress|noun|B1|9|school|📈|Getting better or moving forward.|You are making good progress in English.|sự tiến bộ|
effort|noun|B1|9|school|💪|Hard work when you try to do something.|She puts a lot of effort into her drawing.|nỗ lực|
attention|noun|B1|9|school||Watching, listening or thinking carefully.|Pay attention to the teacher.|sự chú ý|
instruction|noun|B1|9|school||Words that tell you how to do something.|Read the instructions before you start.|hướng dẫn|
method|noun|B1|9|school||A way of doing something.|This is a good method for learning words.|phương pháp|
purpose|noun|B1|9|school||Why something is done or made.|What is the purpose of this button?|mục đích|
quality|noun|B1|9|things||How good or bad something is.|These shoes are good quality.|chất lượng|plural=qualities
amount|noun|B1|9|things||How much of something there is.|Eat a small amount of sugar.|lượng (số lượng)|
pattern|noun|B1|9|things||Shapes or colours that repeat.|The dress has a flower pattern.|hoa văn (mẫu)|
shape|noun|B1|8|things|🔷|The form of something, like a circle or square.|What shape is the box?|hình dạng|
surface|noun|B1|9|things||The top or outside of something.|The surface of the table is smooth.|bề mặt|
edge|noun|B1|9|things||The outside end of something.|Don't stand near the edge of the cliff.|mép (cạnh)|
distance|noun|B1|9|travel|📏|How far it is between two places.|What is the distance from here to the beach?|khoảng cách|
century|noun|B1|9|time||One hundred years.|This house is from the last century.|thế kỷ|plural=centuries
future|noun|B1|9|time|🔮|The time after now.|In the future, I want to be a doctor.|tương lai|
past|noun|B1|9|time||The time before now.|In the past, people didn't have phones.|quá khứ|
period|noun|B1|9|time;school||A length of time, or a lesson at school.|We have maths in the first period.|khoảng thời gian (tiết học)|
moment|noun|B1|9|time||A very short time.|Wait a moment, please.|khoảnh khắc (chốc lát)|
